{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Animation｜表现流程与来源发布\n[[Animation/结构|接口]] · [[GGYGO_结构_动画与表现.canvas|结构图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动画曲线处理.canvas|源曲线/CMC子图]] · [[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|动作姿态子图]]。\n主路径消费语义；旁支发布原配置。姿态沿原生Slot评估，Required票据由Task原生Tick只读检查。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2590,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. CMC / ASC / Pawn 在各自引擎生命周期更新权威状态。\n\n来源接口：CMC::GetResolvedGait/GetWalkRunBlendAlpha/GetStopMotionType/HasMoveInput/GetTurnBackPhase，ASC::HasMatchingGameplayTag，Pawn Transform。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "capture",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. Base原生命周期\n先处理Owner/来源退休与配置发布，再StateCapture.Capture抓当时事实。\nReset清原publication、Frame/Debug和派生表现；新Owner不继承旧数据。\n配置旁支不是Graph采样。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. ABP_Pyrios 读取输入、步态、WalkRun 混合、停止与转身语义。\n\nAnimBP 经 AnimationStateFrame 和只读查询获得事实；旧拆分引脚由兼容层填充。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "transition",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. AnimBP 过渡图选择 EnterMove、Moving、Stop、TurnBack 等状态。\n\nAnimBP 过渡规则消费 StateFrame；C++ 不返回具体 ABP 状态名，EnterMove/Stop/TurnBack 选择留在蓝图。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "play",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. ABP选序列 / WalkRun1D\nGetSeqByKey/GetBlendSpaceByKey；EnterMove/Stop/TurnBack单次，Idle/Loop循环。\nWalkRun X仍用GaitBlendY alpha；本批Player/Evaluator/网络相位保持原状。\n最终物理与表现不承诺同clock。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 932,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "compat",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "兼容路径：ZZZ 适配旧 Snapshot，不持有 Locomotion 计时。\n\n生命周期 Hook 清 Memory、Snapshot、Events 指针上下文与公开表现字段。每帧再执行 LegacySnapshotAdapter::Capture → MapMovementState：WalkRunBlendAlpha → GaitBlendY；StopMotionType → StopValue 0/1/2。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "future",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原配置publication\nBase→CMC.PublishLocomotionSourceBinding(binding,error)。\n保存原identity/代次及Status/Error，只冻结引用/metadata。\nMissing/Invalid不授曲线执行；必需时CMC拒绝，Fixed/GA正常。\n配置不变不重发/不每帧刷Error。",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_entry",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## GA/Task启动原Main\nTask Ready前AcquireActionPoseContract，RequiredReady必须有OnFailed消费者。\nTryPlayMontageWithOwnership沿原生播放；GA捕原snapshot申请CMC Main句柄。\nABP用FullBody ActionPoseSlot。\n[[Animation/普攻动画实施|实际配置]] · [[计划_玩家普攻连段|原GA]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_window",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Montage时间轴\n原生播放触发Hit/Combo Begin/End GameplayEvent。\nGA核原播放来源后消费，Combat命中/伤害归原模块。\n01 Combo在115帧结束，早于116帧BlendOut；完整窗口/命中体验另验。",
      "x": 510,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_end",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 未换段 → End（资产已配置）\nMain.NextSectionName=End，End.NextSectionName=None。\nEnd 取素材前30/45/90帧；Combo跨入End 14/18/18帧。\n默认 BlendOut 从116/111/159帧开始，持续15帧（60 fps）。",
      "x": 1020,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo_return",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## End→原locomotion\nSection变化/结束由GA释放本人Main CMC句柄。\n原生Slot混回持续Update的Source；受理移动可提前Cancel原End。\n两正常叶已真实Walk/Run；End/返回移动的最终pose及完整BlendOut未采。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|证据边界]]",
      "x": 1530,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bh3_import",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1900,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 260,
      "text": "## BH3 Kevin DemonBattle：独立导入\n模型/StandBy已保存与预览；75条可导入动画全部成功，4条源空片段未生成。\n独立Skeleton，保留原始根层级；渲染按槽名接线。\n[[Animation/BH3_Kevin_DemonBattle导入|导入说明与验收]]\n[[GGYGO_流程_BH3_DemonBattle导入.canvas|导入流程子图]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "kevin_combat",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2300,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 310,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## Kevin战斗动画（资产待生成）\n55独立Montage；Ice01/02候选窗口；Prop1端点与独立ABP。\n已有资产只读核验，缺失才创建；Movement提供InPlace并执行位移。\n完整链接与3项Animation安全自动化通过；生产资产及玩法待验收。\n[[Animation/资产生产安全|保护契约]] · [[Animation/Kevin战斗动画实施|实施]] · [[GGYGO_流程_Kevin战斗动画.canvas|生成流程]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "source_resolve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原source配置解析\nNativeInitialize/Update发现实际变化→ZZZ.ResolveLocomotionSourceBinding。\n五单段routes＋实际walkRun BS样本；验证refs/rates/length。\n新配置代次单调跨reinit，旧source不授权新Owner。\n源曲线求值归CMC。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 385,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "source_retire",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Uninitialize / Owner或配置退出\nBase→RetireLocomotionSourceBinding(originalProducer,originalConfigurationGeneration)，仅撤原publication。\n随后清本实例表现；不清后继source/GA资源。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 890,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_evaluate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同次原生AnimGraph评估\nGuard NativeUpdateAnimation在GT核实际Montage输入并发布原native counter/能力。\nActionPoseSlot继承原生Slot Update/Evaluate；PostEvaluateSourcePose只借实际参与Source残差。\nEvaluate只改Body local translation，随后原空间转换/Inertialization输出最终Mesh。\n无再次Source Evaluate、第二mixer或clock。\n[[GGYGO_流程_动作姿态修正.canvas|源借用、公式与失败分支]]",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 470,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_required",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Required依赖存续与失败\nTask原生TickTask→PollActionPoseContract(原ticket)，不积dt。\nValid→继续原Task；Failed/Invalidated→FailActionPoseContract。\n精确原Stop/scale归还/EndTask后历史OnFailed→GA核原Activation/step/Task/资源→RequestAbilityEnd。\n清自身CMC句柄；CanBeCanceled=false也不阻止依赖失败End。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|Task/GA清理]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正|能力契约]]",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "action_pose_capsule",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 胶囊与最终姿态分开验\nGA的BeginMontageActionMotion→CMC按原PosXYZ区间/RMS执行胶囊，来源与句柄精确清理。\nBodyZ只属Mesh姿态；不回写CMC速度/加速度/输入。\n最终Body证据仅Normal01 Main；两故障行为PASS但报告Fail，真实Error保留。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|动作CMC接口]] · [[Animation/动作姿态修正#7. 实际证据与未验证边界|已验/缺口]]",
      "x": 2050,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
